# Section 11: everything the eval gate trusts needs an owner's review. A pull_request run uses the workflow file,
# gate code and recordings from the pull request itself, so these paths are the gate. Replace the team with yours,
# and turn on "Require review from Code Owners" for main.
/.github/workflows/   @skyops/eval-owners
/.github/CODEOWNERS   @skyops/eval-owners
/skyops/evals/        @skyops/eval-owners
/skyops/agent/disruption.py @skyops/eval-owners
/fixtures/            @skyops/eval-owners
/data/evals/          @skyops/eval-owners
/data/prompts/        @skyops/eval-owners
/config/              @skyops/eval-owners
/tools/               @skyops/eval-owners
/Makefile             @skyops/eval-owners
